# Rules

Meta-rules in `Rules-of-Rules.md`; the one rule document today
(`dev-environment-rules.md`, prefix `env`) sits flat at this level —
tooling/process rules, not product behavior. A second rule document for
product code (e.g. `catalyst-core-rules.md`) is expected once real
application work starts (`INSTANTIATION-GUIDE.md` §3 step 5).
`templates/TEMPLATE-RULE-v1.md` is the only template file allowed at
this root. `rules.md` is the global index — every rule ID must appear
there (`Rules-of-Rules.md` §5).
